### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/health

### Run the complete guarded daily pipeline (idempotent for channel/day)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/channels/{{channel_id}}/automation/run
Authorization: Bearer {{operator_token}}

### Review and approve all four immutable private platform bundles
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/automation/{{automation_run_id}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{operator_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"comment": "Video, claims, rights, disclosures, destinations, privacy and schedules reviewed."}

### Record the 24-hour outcome and generate a diagnosis
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/analytics/publications/{{publication_id}}/snapshots
Authorization: Bearer {{operator_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "window": "24h",
  "metrics": {
    "impressions": 1000,
    "views": 800,
    "average_watch_percent": 62,
    "completion_rate": 45,
    "rewatch_rate": 12,
    "shares": 24,
    "saves": 16,
    "meaningful_comments": 8,
    "profile_visits": 30,
    "followers_gained": 10
  }
}

### Create topic candidate
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/topics
Authorization: Bearer {{operator_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "channel_id": "{{channel_id}}",
  "title": "When silence becomes punishment",
  "angle": "Distinguish healthy space from conditional withdrawal.",
  "content_pillar": "hidden_manipulation_patterns",
  "risk_penalty": 2,
  "confidence": 85,
  "scores": {
    "trend_velocity": 90,
    "emotional_resonance": 92,
    "relatability": 95,
    "curiosity_gap": 85,
    "share_intent": 88,
    "comment_potential": 80,
    "channel_fit": 98,
    "novelty": 75
  }
}

### Select topic
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/topics/{{topic_id}}/select
Authorization: Bearer {{operator_token}}

### Generate script
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/projects/{{project_id}}/generate-script
Authorization: Bearer {{operator_token}}

### Prepare publication and immutable approval packet
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/projects/{{project_id}}/prepare-publication
Authorization: Bearer {{operator_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "platform": "youtube",
  "metadata": {
    "title": "When Silence Becomes Punishment",
    "caption": "Healthy space communicates. Punishment demands surrender.",
    "hashtags": ["relationships", "mensmentalhealth"]
  },
  "media_checksum": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa",
  "scheduled_for": "2026-10-01T18:00:00Z",
  "account_reference": "youtube-channel-1"
}

### Approve
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/approvals/{{approval_id}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{operator_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"comment": "Video, claims, metadata, disclosures and destination reviewed."}

### Dispatch through configured publisher
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/publications/{{publication_id}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{operator_token}}
